      "content": "but a pause isn't enough. a pause just means you're waiting for something that's never coming back. if the main character is gone, the story is just dragging on unnecessarily. it feels more like an obligation to stay than anything else. like i'm just haunting my own life. doesn't it seem weird to keep going when the thing that made you *you* is just... done?",
